<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2059775142"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1765320222"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Feel Alive"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="R3BIRTH"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Feel Alive / Go Our Way！（虹ヶ咲学園スクールアイドル同好会盤）"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:19.867"><div begin="00:02.108" end="03:01.008"><p begin="00:02.108" end="00:05.995" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">嘿, 准备好就一起走<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿，准备好就一起走</span></p><p begin="00:07.244" end="00:10.112" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">No more rules, No more rails<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身无拘，摆脱束缚</span></p><p begin="00:10.745" end="00:14.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">今広がるのは自由な世界<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 自由的世界映入眼帘</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma hi ro ga ru no ha ji yu u na se ka i</span></p><p begin="00:14.847" end="00:16.331" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">We go, Listen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摆脱脚上的枷锁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha zu re ta a shi ka se</span></p><p begin="00:16.031" end="00:19.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">外れた足枷 We all opened the bird cage<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脱落的脚镣 我们不被鸟笼所困扰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha zu re ta a shi ka se</span></p><p begin="00:19.281" end="00:21.767" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Hey, Can I trust me? It's beginning 飛べる自在に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿，相信我好吗？ 一切始于此 我心自由飞翔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">It's beginning to be ru ji za i ni</span></p><p begin="00:21.767" end="00:25.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">无尽的天空 確かな Don't have a map 去哪儿好呢<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并没有明确的地图</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta shi ka na don't have a map</span></p><p begin="00:25.335" end="00:29.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">第一次的经验 , Feeling, この景色 噛み締めよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用直觉细细品味眼前光景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Feeling ko no ke shi ki ka mi shi me yo u</span></p><p begin="00:29.484" end="00:31.019" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Back in the days ほら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 回望过往时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Back in the days ho ra</span></p><p begin="00:31.020" end="00:33.953" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">刻んできた轍 背中押すから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一路铭刻的轨迹 是我们前行的动力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki za n de ki ta wa da chi se na ka o su ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:33.953" end="00:35.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">今だから Understand 無駄じゃなかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因为是现在才终于懂得</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma da ka ra understand</span></p><p begin="00:35.769" end="00:37.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Look for the better days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都绝非徒劳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu da ja na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.871" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Never weighed down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们即将拥有崭新双翼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra shi i tsu ba sa we know we got it</span></p><p begin="00:37.871" end="00:39.989" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">新しい翼 We know we got it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐现雏形 羽翼崭新</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra shi i tsu ba sa we know we got it</span></p><p begin="00:40.272" end="00:41.805" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">So, 飞翔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以，飞翔</span></p><p begin="00:41.855" end="00:44.824" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">風に乗れ To the unknown world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">乘风前往未知新世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ni no re to the unknown world</span></p><p begin="00:45.072" end="00:48.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">共に Just keep going forward<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一同迈进 一往无前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to mo ni just keep going forward</span></p><p begin="00:48.175" end="00:54.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">在るべき姿で 心鳴る方へ行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以理想的身姿 踏上激动人心的旅途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru be ki su ga ta de ko ko ro na ru ho u he i ko u</span></p><p begin="00:54.560" end="00:57.295" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">とめどなく溢れる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加速的心跳难以抑制</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to me do na ku a fu re ru</span></p><p begin="00:57.295" end="01:00.722" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Feel alive, feel alive, feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身，无拘，所见，所想</span></p><p begin="01:00.822" end="01:06.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">徨う事あれど Everything is so fine きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使时而陷入彷徨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ma yo u ko to a re do</span></p><p begin="01:07.162" end="01:09.881" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">「私」を叫べ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声呐喊“我”的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 wa ta shi 」 wo sa ke be</span></p><p begin="01:09.963" end="01:13.503" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Feel alive, feel alive, feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挣脱，束缚，破茧，而出</span></p><p begin="01:26.007" end="01:29.187" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Look that, まだ It ain't hitting me yet<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不会再次被眼前劲敌击倒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Look that ma da it ain't hitting me yet</span></p><p begin="01:29.287" end="01:32.208" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Flying by myself 自分の意思で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将随心所欲 独自翱翔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Flying by myself ji bu n no i shi de</span></p><p begin="01:32.368" end="01:35.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">不断往前遨游 どこにたどり着こうと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断往前遨游 不论去向何方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ni ta do ri tsu ko u to</span></p><p begin="01:35.651" end="01:38.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">I can't blame anyone (Anymore, anymore)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能责怪任何人（不再，需要）</span></p><p begin="01:38.953" end="01:40.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">The breaking dawn ほら (看)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看那天际破晓(看)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">The breaking dawn ho ra ( kan )</span></p><p begin="01:40.553" end="01:43.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Why is it 同じ空 (为什么) が Looks 鮮やか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何熟悉的天空(为什么)看起来如此鲜艳耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Why is it o na ji so ra ( wei shen me ) ga looks a za ya ka</span></p><p begin="01:43.321" end="01:45.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">今だから Understand これでよかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因为是现在才终于懂得 这样就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma da ka ra understand ko re de yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:45.202" end="01:46.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Look for the destiny<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">揭幕命运</span></p><p begin="01:46.441" end="01:49.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">All day, all night その瞳に焼き付けて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽数烙印于眼底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no hi to mi ni ya ki tsu ke te</span></p><p begin="01:49.662" end="01:51.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">So, Free them<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以，释放吧</span></p><p begin="01:51.383" end="01:57.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">探さなくたって 私は心(ここ)にいるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无需刻意找寻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ga sa na ku ta 't te</span></p><p begin="01:57.664" end="02:00.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">身体中を駆ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浑身游走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ra da ju u wo ka ke ru</span></p><p begin="02:00.466" end="02:03.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Feel alive, feel alive, feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身，无拘，所见，所想</span></p><p begin="02:04.067" end="02:09.171" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">時に嵐待てど Everything is so fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时而袭来的暴风雨亟待突破</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ni a ra shi ma te do</span></p><p begin="02:09.171" end="02:12.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">もっと「私」を謳え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情讴歌“我”的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 wa ta shi 」 wo u ta e</span></p><p begin="02:13.091" end="02:16.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Feel alive, feel alive, feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挣脱，束缚，破茧，而出</span></p><p begin="02:16.833" end="02:19.694" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">The sky's shining bright oh baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空溢出闪亮哦 我的宝贝</span></p><p begin="02:19.994" end="02:27.555" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">不確かな旅でも 広がる景色全て確かなこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使旅途充满未知</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta shi ka na ta bi de mo</span></p><p begin="02:27.574" end="02:31.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Yeah, we found a way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错，我们找到了属于我们的路</span></p><p begin="02:29.278" end="02:32.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">風に乗れ To the unknown world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">乘风前往未知新世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ni no re to the unknown world</span></p><p begin="02:32.417" end="02:35.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">共に Just keep going forward<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一同迈进 一往无前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to mo ni just keep going forward</span></p><p begin="02:35.619" end="02:41.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">在るべき姿で 心鳴る方へ行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以理想的身姿 踏上激动人心的旅途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru be ki su ga ta de ko ko ro na ru ho u he i ko u</span></p><p begin="02:41.943" end="02:44.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">とめどなく溢れる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加速的心跳难以抑制</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to me do na ku a fu re ru</span></p><p begin="02:44.719" end="02:48.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Feel alive, feel alive, feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身，无拘，所见，所想</span></p><p begin="02:48.163" end="02:54.365" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">徨う事あれど Everything is so fine きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使时而陷入彷徨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ma yo u ko to a re do</span></p><p begin="02:54.525" end="02:57.127" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">「私」を叫べ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声呐喊“我”的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 wa ta shi 」 wo sa ke be</span></p><p begin="02:57.347" end="03:01.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Feel alive, feel alive, feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挣脱，束缚，破茧，而出</span></p></div></body></tt>